From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason920612 <jasonya2206@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:08:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional event and shadow statistics

-Dquire.eventStats=true records per-event dispatch counts and listener time; -Dquire.shadow=true records, for every entity/block entity/chunk tick unit, how far from its own chunk it reached and whether it fired a listened event. Both are off by default (static final flags).

